<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
The ids of the children to run, in insertion order, after applying the ``.ini`` file&apos;s
:cpp:member:`IniFile::filteredToModTypeIds` :raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;` :raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;`

